B.2 Notasi Big O (SubCPMK-2 (5%))
6. Jabarkanlah perhitungan time complexity dari kode program berikut (5 Poin):
static int pairSumSequence(int n) {
var sum = 0;
for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {

sum = sum + pairSum(i, i+1);
}
return sum;
}

static int pairSum(int a, int b) {
return a + b;
}
